@SystemData_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5111

### Consultar registros en cuarentena
GET {{SystemData_Api_HostAddress}}/api/commerce/quarantine
Accept: application/json

### Procesar registros de una fecha
POST {{SystemData_Api_HostAddress}}/api/commerce/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processDate": "2026-10-16"
}
